  "description": "SQLitePCLRaw is a Portable Class Library (PCL) for low-level (raw) access to SQLite.  Packages named 'SQLitePCLRaw.provider.*' (like this one) are 'plugins' that allow SQLitePCLRaw.core to access the native SQLite library.  This provider does DllImport of 'e_sqlcipher', the unofficial SQLCipher builds provided with SQLitePCLRaw.",
